# ==============================================================================
# Terraform
# ==============================================================================
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.*.backup
terraform.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
crash.log
crash.*.log

# tfvars may contain sensitive values — only commit if they are scrubbed
# environments/*/terraform.tfvars are committed intentionally (no secrets, only refs)
# Uncomment the line below if you do NOT want to commit any tfvars:
# *.tfvars

# Lock files SHOULD be committed to pin provider versions
# .terraform.lock.hcl  ← do NOT ignore

# ==============================================================================
# Secrets and credentials — NEVER commit
# ==============================================================================
*.pem
*.p8
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*_rsa
*_rsa.pub
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.asc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
credentials/

